 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "Grandpa, I use Incognito.",
   "s": 0,
   "e": 1.58,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody sees what I browse.",
   "s": 1.64,
   "e": 2.97,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody on your phone.",
   "s": 3.26,
   "e": 4.77,
   "line": 2,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Everybody else sees it.",
   "s": 4.92,
   "e": 6.24,
   "line": 2,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Everybody? Who?",
   "s": 6.3,
   "e": 7.79,
   "line": 3,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "The website, first.",
   "s": 8.04,
   "e": 9.31,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "It gets your internet address,",
   "s": 9.58,
   "e": 10.62,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "like any visitor.",
   "s": 10.68,
   "e": 12.06,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "And the router?",
   "s": 12.12,
   "e": 12.92,
   "line": 5,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Every request goes through the router,",
   "s": 12.98,
   "e": 14.78,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "then your provider.",
   "s": 14.84,
   "e": 15.89,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Think postman.",
   "s": 16.1,
   "e": 17.17,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "He reads the address",
   "s": 17.32,
   "e": 18.08,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "on every envelope.",
   "s": 18.14,
   "e": 19.5,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then what does Incognito hide?",
   "s": 19.56,
   "e": 21.43,
   "line": 7,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Your history.",
   "s": 21.76,
   "e": 22.77,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Close the window,",
   "s": 23.06,
   "e": 23.72,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "and your phone forgets the visit.",
   "s": 23.78,
   "e": 25.97,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Forgets. That's all?",
   "s": 26.26,
   "e": 28.11,
   "line": 9,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Like wiping the table.",
   "s": 28.32,
   "e": 29.79,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "The meal still happened.",
   "s": 30.04,
   "e": 31.43,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "The waiter saw it.",
   "s": 31.76,
   "e": 32.96,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Wait. Even if I'm logged in?",
   "s": 33.02,
   "e": 34.91,
   "line": 11,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then you've told them your name.",
   "s": 35.02,
   "e": 36.41,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "They file it under you.",
   "s": 36.68,
   "e": 38.22,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "And at school?",
   "s": 38.28,
   "e": 39,
   "line": 13,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "At work?",
   "s": 39.06,
   "e": 39.75,
   "line": 13,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Whoever runs that network",
   "s": 39.94,
   "e": 40.94,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "can log it.",
   "s": 41,
   "e": 41.97,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Incognito can't touch them.",
   "s": 42.16,
   "e": 43.81,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "So what's it good for?",
   "s": 43.9,
   "e": 45.05,
   "line": 15,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Hiding a birthday present",
   "s": 45.12,
   "e": 46.18,
   "line": 16,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "from your sister.",
   "s": 46.24,
   "e": 47.19,
   "line": 16,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "That's all?",
   "s": 47.3,
   "e": 48.15,
   "line": 17,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "The shoe shop still knows.",
   "s": 48.54,
   "e": 49.98,
   "line": 18,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Your sister doesn't.",
   "s": 50.04,
   "e": 51.83,
   "line": 18,
   "sp": "A"
  }
 ],
